ral-property property\">age</span> <span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">20</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\n\r\n  <span class=\"token function\">render</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\r\n      <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>div<span class=\"token operator\">></span> 안녕 <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">this</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>state<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>name <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>div<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\r\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"class-컴포넌트에서-state-변경하기\" style=\"position:relative;\">class 컴포넌트에서 state 변경하기<a href=\"#class-%EC%BB%B4%ED%8F%AC%EB%84%8C%ED%8A%B8%EC%97%90%EC%84%9C-state-%EB%B3%80%EA%B2%BD%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0\" aria-label=\"class 컴포넌트에서 state 변경하기 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-